<title>UK: Banco Rio prices two FRNs worth total $580 million.</title>
<headline>Banco Rio prices two FRNs worth total $580 million.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-08-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>Banco Rio de la Plata, controlled by Banco  Santander SA, has priced the following two FRNs, lead manager Citibank  International said.</p>
<p>+ + +</p>
<p> AMT	  $500 MLN  BASE	 1M-LIBOR  MATURITY    10.AUG.98</p>
<p> TYPE	 FRN	 MARGIN     +55 BP    PAY DATE    11.AUG.97</p>
<p> LISTING    B.AIRES   DENOMS (K) 10	  GOV LAW     NEW YORK</p>
<p>+ + +</p>
<p> AMT	  $80 MLN   BASE	 6M-LIBOR  MATURITY    09.NOV.99</p>
<p> TYPE	 FRN	 MARGIN    *+75 BP    PAY DATE    11.AUG.97</p>
<p> LISTING    B.AIRES   DENOMS (K) 10	  GOV LAW     NEW YORK</p>
<p> NOTES     *STEPS UP TO 87.5 BP FROM AUG.98.</p>
<p>		LAST COUPON AUG.99-NOV.99 BASED ON THREE-MONTH LIBOR</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 8863</p>
